
### Valid payment
POST http://localhost:8080/practice/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountCents": 5000, "note": "October payment"}

### Negative amount (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/practice/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountCents": -50}

### Missing amount (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/practice/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "forgot the amount"}

### Broken JSON (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/practice/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"amountCents": 5000